{"name":"Promise Keeping","hex":"#afc7e8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"promise","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An oath or affirmation; a vow.","A transaction between two persons whereby the first person undertakes in the future to render some service or gift to the second person or devotes something valuable now and here to their use."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To commit to (some action or outcome), or to assure (a person) of such commitment; to make an oath or vow.","To give grounds for expectation, especially of something good."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/promise"},{"term":"keeping","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Conformity or harmony.","Charge or care."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of keep"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/keeping"}],"entries":[{"title":"Promise","blocks":[{"text":"A promise is a commitment by someone to do or not do something. As a noun promise means a declaration assuring that one will or will not do something. As a verb it means to commit oneself by a promise to do or give. It can also mean a capacity for good, similar to a value that is to be realized in the near future."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Promise","wikidata":"Q1425577"},{"title":"Keeping","blocks":[{"text":"Keeping is a surname. Notable people with the surname include:"},{"items":["Charles Keeping (1924–1988), British illustrator, children's book author and lithographer","Damien Keeping, Australian rules football coach","Frederick Keeping (1867–1950), British racing cyclist","Jack Keeping, English cricketer","Janet Keeping, Canadian professor and politician","Jeff Keeping, Canadian Football League defensive tackle","Max Keeping (1942–2015), Canadian television news anchor","Michael Keeping (1902–1984), English footballer and manager","Tom Keeping (1942–2020), Canadian politician","Walter Keeping (1854–1888), British geologist and museum curator"]}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keeping","wikidata":"Q6383244"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Immigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg/500px-Immigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Immigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg/1280px-Immigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Immigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg/500px-Immigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"American immigrants seen swearing the Oath of Allegiance in 2010","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AImmigrants_to_the_United_States_take_the_Oath_of_Allegiance.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/William_Holman_Hunt_-_Rienzi_vowing_to_obtain_justice.jpg/500px-William_Holman_Hunt_-_Rienzi_vowing_to_obtain_justice.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/William_Holman_Hunt_-_Rienzi_vowing_to_obtain_justice.jpg/1280px-William_Holman_Hunt_-_Rienzi_vowing_to_obtain_justice.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/William_Holman_Hunt_-_Rienzi_vowing_to_obtain_justice.jpg/500px-William_Holman_Hunt_-_Rienzi_vowing_to_obtain_justice.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A painting depicting Cola di Rienzo as vowing to obtain justice","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWilliam_Holman_H